name=Zomboid Fixes B42.20
id=ZomboidFixesB42
author=Tien
description=A collection of fixes for Build 42.20, mostly for multiplayer.
description=- Fast Timed Actions makes item transfers quick in multiplayer.
description=- Changing an animal's gender now swaps the animal's model and type with it, and sticks for everyone.
description=- The foraging debug menu works, and added icons can be picked up.
description=- Item editor changes save for items anywhere, not just your own inventory.
description=- The debug Add Fluid option fills rain collectors and other fluid containers for real, and everyone sees it.
description=- Admins with Fast Move on no longer die from falls on stairs (optional).
description=- The admin tag shows for every admin cheat, with an option to hide it.
description=- Items with negative weight are deleted automatically (optional).
description=- Clothing destroyed while worn now stays destroyed after relogging (optional).
description=- Metal and Articulated Metal Shin Armor run speeds are no longer swapped.
description=- Chickens deleted by the game when they finish laying in a hutch are put back (optional).
description=- Hutches and nest boxes can be made to get dirty more slowly (optional).
description=- Guns of Marz attachment tooltips no longer stretch across the screen (optional).
description=- Running players no longer vault stair railings by accident (optional).
description=- Fast forward in multiplayer, when every player votes for it (optional).
description=- Shift-click selects a full range with Nick's Inventory Selection Fix (optional).
description=- Turbo Game cartridges, batteries and mood effects work on servers, playing no longer moves your character, and games close near zombies or in the dark (optional, beta).
description=- Admins who join are fully healed and briefly in god mode, so a revived admin does not die again (optional).
description=Must be installed on both the server and clients.
modversion=1.0
